{"articleNo":"154132","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=154132&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016년 여름 방학중 대구통학버스 운행 하지 않음","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.07.13","hit":"3575","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2015-2학기 동계 방학까지 운행되던 방학중 무료 대구통학버스가 이번학기 부터 예산이 배정되지 않아서 운행이 중단되었습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">대구에서&nbsp;통학하는 교직원 및 학생들의 편의를 위하여 수익자 부담으로 운행하기 위하여 이용자 수요조사를 실시하였습니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 조사기간 : 2016. 6. 20(월) ~ 6. 30(목) [11일간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 조사방법 : 학교 홈페이지 팝업 및 공지사항에 게제</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수요조사 결과</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; - 응답자 50명(교직원 17명, 학생 33명)</span></p><p><!--StartFragment--></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.41pt solid; HEIGHT: 31.3pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 56.77pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.41pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\" rowspan=\"2\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.41pt solid; HEIGHT: 15.65pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; WIDTH: 170.06pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이용요금에 관계없이 이용</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.41pt solid; HEIGHT: 15.65pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.41pt solid; WIDTH: 170.06pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이용요금에 따라 이용여부 결정</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 15.65pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 85.03pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교직원</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; HEIGHT: 15.65pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; WIDTH: 85.03pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1